OL,3,GNEWSADad thanks DIY SOS team as son's
OL,4,A'miracle' homecoming shown
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan needs non-invasive ventilation at
OL,7,Fnights. But his family home needed
OL,8,Fmajor adaptations for him to receive
OL,9,Fthe ventilation there.
OL,11,FHis father, Nigel, told BBC Radio
OL,12,FLancashire: "When your life is turned
OL,13,Fupside down you have to learn to live
OL,14,Fagain."
